<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 173 0 R
/E (Unlike a single-shot chatbot, VARUNA's planner agent decomposes compound questions into sub-tasks handled by specialized agents : SQL generation, retrieval, cross-domain entity-resolution, comparison. A dedicated anomaly agent continuously watches incoming ocean data and pushes heatwave/anomaly alerts without waiting to be asked. Every answer is narrative, chart, or map traces back to a source record, and session memory keeps multi-turn conversations coherent.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
